    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16577" root="رم" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُمَّانٌ</span></b>  is of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُعْلَانٌ</span> accord. to Sb:
accord. to Abu-l-Hasan [i. e. Akh], of the measure
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُعَّالٌ</span>, (M, TA,) and is [therefore] mentioned in
the S and K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رمن</span> [q. v.]: (TA:) the n. un.
is with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>. (M.)

